  "body": "![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0bede47e62beb5e7bdfecbda07668bf78e386dea.png)\n#\n <center>\n \n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Mtcd\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/211a96955ba8beeafaf0140682832e34f73fe2ff.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Modrinth Page\"/>\n</a>\n   \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/VkKkKwyDKH\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e1f34d39f5cb7ef6cc84d0a871463ce7201a2644.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Discord Link\"/>\n</a>\n   \n#\n\n<center>\n  \n### **Description**\n\nWhy is the cold chicken the only one with a tail? Well this pack adds it for all of them, Even the babies!\n\n<center>\n\n#\n\n### **Requirements**\n  \n\n <center>\n \n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb11c74b2469d912c33123a745ff77296daee59f.webp\" width=\"80\" alt=\"EMF\"/>\n</a>\n\n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2401775bd01a454f187e74d7d0c1e32b9f3c734.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"ETF\"/>\n</a>\n   ",
